{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \n\nGO:0035268 protein mannosylation\n\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29770\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/12HWZcWSsOkXZAyVWAMSn0PAqimiwyt2Y9C21NPbGt7Q/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\n\nImpacted groups: \n\n~CGD 6~ DONE\n~ComplexPortal 1~ DONE\nGeneDB 1\n~HGNC-UCL 1~ DONE\n~MGI 1~ DONE\nUniProt 1\n\n\nFor protein mannosylation,  most likely replacement is \nO-linked protein mannosylation\n\nbut may also be\nN-linked protein glycosylation (dolichol-linked oligosaccharide biosynthetic process)\nC-linked protein glycosylation\nGPI anchor biosynthetic process\n\nEach needs to be checked  to decide where it fits.\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-06-02T15:49:28Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0035268 protein mannosylation", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-11-24T14:15:15Z"}
